# DRC-EDGE-2: edge4way nfet ndiff 2 ndiff,ndc ndiff 2 "ov"; diffusion extension 1 on one side, 2 on the other.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load top
box 2 0 7 10
paint ndiff
box 3 -2 5 12
paint poly
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save top
